# Linear inbox (Helm)

Notes live in Linear workspace **CamLab**, project **Helm**, team **CamLab** (issue prefix `CAM-`).

## Status flow

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Backlog | Phone dump / raw note |
| Todo | Ready for Cursor |
| In Progress | Actively building |
| In Review | PR / device check |
| Done / Canceled | Closed |

## Labels

`Note` (raw), `Bug`, `Feature`, `Improvement`, `Chore`.

## Agent behavior

- When Cameron asks to work inbox / Linear / a `CAM-*` id: use Linear MCP (`list_issues`, `get_issue`, `save_issue`, `save_comment`). Prefer **Todo** then **Backlog**.
- Default: brief plan first; build only when he says build.
- After plan or ship: comment on the issue; update status when appropriate.
- Do not set up Cursor Automations or TestFlight for this loop unless he asks.
- Guide doc: Linear project Helm → document "How to use this inbox".
